<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADS ENDS UP AT $45 (FIM 204.8).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADS ENDS UP AT $45 (FIM 204.8).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADS closed up $0-1/8 at $45 in New York last Friday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 204.8 markka. In Helsinki Friday, Nokia A closed up 0.50 markka at 203.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADS (two shares) closed $0-3/8 higher at $33-1/8 on Wall Street. The price equals about 75.4 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed 0.10 markka down at 75.90.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADS closed $0-1/2 down at $20-1/2 (93.3 markka) in New York. Rauma ended unchanged in Helsinki at 94.50 markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
